  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview (這支流程是 SRC_BAPIv2.2_DATAELEMENT_OUTPUT_E 模組的最上層主流程（也就是您目前選中的 Sequence_3），功能是：連線SAP，撈出指定表格的欄位結構定義（也就是「這張表有哪些欄位、型態、長度」），並輸出成一份Excel範本檔，這份Excel後續會被 SRC_BAPIv2.2_TABLEDATA_OUTPUT_E 模組拿來當作「查詢條件設定檔」使用。)&#xA;Output SAP Table Element Info as Excel file based on the Table name defined in Argument. The file format can be processed by SRC_BAPIv2.2_TABLEDATA_OUTPUT_E.&#xA;&#xA;- input&#xA;in_TableName as name of target Table &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_OutPath as file path of output file &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_OutFileName as name of output file &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_AppServer as AppServer &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_Client as Client &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_Language as Language &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_Password as Password &lt;SecureString&gt;&#xA;in_SystemNumber as SystemNumber &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_User as User &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_FunctionXamlFilePath as Function xaml file path used for data output &lt;String&gt;" DisplayName="SRC_BAPIv2.2_DATAELEMENT_OUTPUT_E" sap:VirtualizedContainerService.HintSize="880,3478" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_3">
    <Sequence.Variables>
